---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { testimonials } from '../site';
---

<Base
  title="Emma West Counselling"
  description="Online counselling with Emma West, a BACP accredited counsellor, wherever you are."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Emma West<br />Counselling</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="section wash">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="lede">Online counselling for you, wherever you are</p>
      <p>
        Hello - my name is Emma - I am an experienced, BACP accredited counsellor with
        specialist training in online counselling.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've found that the vast majority of my clients benefit from psycho education
        [learning about how the brain works but without needing to be a neuroscientist!]
        - say hello to your 'Monkey' brain... and most want practical strategies and
        techniques that they can easily apply to effect change. If that sounds like you
        then please get in touch.
      </p>
      <p>
        I can help you with a range of issues including stress, low mood, anxiety,
        dissatisfaction at work or with life in general, low self esteem/confidence,
        relationship/family problems, parenting issues, loss, anger and trauma.
      </p>
      <p>
        I also have specialist experience and knowledge of disability, carer, health,
        student and gender dysphoria issues, and I am LGBTQIA2S+ affirmative. I have
        lived experience of rare disability and carer issues.
      </p>
      <p>
        I charge £60 for a 50 minute session which includes being sent resources post
        session for you to refer to and keep.
      </p>
      <p>
        While I can't give you medical advice I can support you if you are thinking about
        taking, are taking, or wish to stop taking, psychiatric drugs eg
        'antidepressants'.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wash" aria-label="Therapy sessions">
    <div class="cards two">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="/images/therapy-sessions.jpg" alt="A counselling session on a laptop" width="476" height="427" />
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>How can I help you?</h2>
        <p>Whatever you are finding difficult, painful or confusing</p>
        <p>I can work with you to achieve positive change</p>
        <p>through Online Counselling.</p>
        <p><a class="read-more" href="/how-can-i-help-you">Read More</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wash">
    <div class="cards two">
      <div class="card">
        <h2>About me</h2>
        <p>Find out more about my background, counselling experience, qualifications</p>
        <p>and training.</p>
        <p><a class="read-more" href="/about-me">Read More</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img
          src="/images/emma-and-luna.jpg"
          alt="Emma smiling with a dog"
          width="400"
          height="334"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wash">
    <div class="cards three">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Why have online counselling</h3>
        <p>There are many advantages to online counselling in terms of time, cost and location.</p>
        <p><a class="read-more" href="/why-have-online-counselling">Read More</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>My approach</h3>
        <p>
          The most important thing in counselling is the ‘therapeutic relationship’ – a
          good counsellor is one who leaves you feeling you are being listened to, cared
          for and not judged.
        </p>
        <p><a class="read-more" href="/my-approach">Read More</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Frequently asked questions</h3>
        <p>
          Everything [hopefully!] you'll want to know about the service I provide [and
          if it's not here - please just ask]
        </p>
        <p><a class="read-more" href="/frequently-asked-questions">Read More</a></p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wash" aria-label="Testimonials">
    <div class="section-inner">
      {
        testimonials.map((quote) => (
          <blockquote class="quote">
            <p>{quote}</p>
          </blockquote>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
